It seems to be a bug or restriction in GrapheneOS or base android. I even set Voicemail notification to None in both owner and user and it still played a ding. GrapheneOS has made it so we cannot disable notifications in the Phone app. We should be able to leave the icon and have no sound or completely disable per category.

Blocking even at my carrier is not viable as these scammers are using thousands of random numbers spoofed.

@grapheneos can you please look into this? Why am I still being notified when I have blocked a number in both Phone/messagaging and third party apps?
